{"step_index":1892,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:26:37Z","input_tokens":3054,"cache_read_tokens":131150,"output_tokens":3007,"content":"A dedicated **[📊 Tax & ITR Filing]** dashboard tab has been implemented alongside the existing **[🧾 Invoice Math Audit]** tab, providing a customizable, deterministic tax engine with shared reactive state.\n\n---\n\n### Key Implementations\n\n#### 1. Tab Navigation Bar ([`ReviewWorkspace.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/ReviewWorkspace.js))\n- Added an interactive tab switcher directly above the review layout:\n  - **Tab 1: [🧾 Invoice Math Audit]**: Shows the live audit badge (e.g. `Math Verified & Valid` or `₹X Overcharge`).\n  - **Tab 2: [📊 Tax & ITR Filing]**: Displays the new compliance & tax planning dashboard with `Custom Engine` badge.\n- **Tab 1 Preserved Untouched:** The PDF/image preview, bounding boxes, interactive line-item table, math discrepancy engine, GST split inputs, quick rate buttons, and mobile views remain untouched.\n- **Shared Reactive State:** Updates in Tab 1 (such as editing billed amounts or GST splits) immediately reflect in Tab 2's ITC metrics and COGS auto-fill. Likewise, adjusting tax parameters in Tab 2 updates calculations live without losing state.\n\n---\n\n#### 2. Customizable Tax & ITR Engine ([`taxCalculator.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/taxCalculator.js), [`TaxFilingDashboard.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/TaxFilingDashboard.js))\n\n##### A. Regime & Filing Scheme Selector\n- **Tax Regime Toggle:** Switch dynamically between **[New Tax Regime (Section 115BAC - Default)]** and **[Old Tax Regime]**.\n- **Mode A: \"Regular Business (Normal P&L - ITR-3)\"**:\n  - Inputs for:\n    - **Annual Gross Revenue / Sales (₹)**\n    - **Cost of Goods Sold (Purchases)** with a 1-click **`[⚡ Auto-fill from Current Bill (₹X)]`** helper or custom manual input.\n    - **Other Operating Expenses (Rent, Power, Salaries, Misc) (₹)**.\n  - Computes: $\\text{Net Taxable Profit} = \\max(0, \\text{Gross Revenue} - \\text{Total Expenses})$.\n- **Mode B: \"Presumptive Taxation (Section 44AD - ITR-4 Sugam)\"**:\n  - Interactive slider for **Digital (UPI/Bank) % vs Cash %** (0% to 100%).\n  - Editable profit rates:\n    - Digital Profit % (Default: 6%, customizable)\n    - Cash Profit % (Default: 8%, customizable)\n  - Computes: $\\text{Deemed Profit} = (\\text{Digital Sales} \\times \\text{Digital \\%}) + (\\text{Cash Sales} \\times \\text{Cash \\%})$.\n\n##### B. Custom Deductions & Exemptions Panel\n- **New Tax Regime:**\n  - Auto-applies standard deduction of **₹75,000** (Budget 2024 / FY 2025-26).\n  - **Section 87A Full Rebate Banner:** When net taxable income is $\\le$ ₹7,00,000, displays a prominent alert: **`🎉 ₹0 Tax Payable! (100% Tax Rebate under Sec 87A)`**.\n- **Old Tax Regime:**\n  - Inputs for:\n    - **Sec 80C** (PPF, LIC, Tuition up to ₹1,50,000)\n    - **Sec 80D** (Health Insurance up to ₹50,000)\n    - **Standard / Other Deductions** (₹50,000)\n  - Computes total deductions and validates Old Regime Section 87A rebate ($\\le$ ₹5,00,000).\n\n##### C. Dynamic Tax Slab Computation Engine (FY 2025-26 / 2026-27)\n- Live slab breakdown table displaying taxable amount and tax in each bracket:\n  - New Regime Slabs: ₹0–3L (0%), ₹3–7L (5%), ₹7–10L (10%), ₹10–12L (15%), ₹12–15L (20%), Above ₹15L (30%).\n  - Old Regime Slabs: ₹0–2.5L (0%), ₹2.5–5L (5%), ₹5–10L (20%), Above ₹10L (30%).\n- Real-time tax math stack:\n  - Gross Tax $\\rightarrow$ Less Sec 87A Rebate $\\rightarrow$ Add 4% Health & Education Cess $\\rightarrow$ **Total Estimated Income Tax Payable (₹)**.\n  - **Effective Tax Rate (%)** calculated against annual gross receipts.\n\n##### D. GST Input Tax Credit (ITC) Audit Card\n- Reads current verified invoice taxes: **CGST (₹)**, **SGST (₹)**, **IGST (₹)**, and **Total Bill GST (₹)**.\n- **Business Resale Toggle:**\n  - **`[Yes]`**: Flags as **`100% Eligible ITC for GSTR-3B Set-off`** (subject to valid supplier GSTIN under Section 16).\n  - **`[No]`**: Flags as **`Ineligible / Blocked Credit under Sec 17(5)`** (personal consumption, motor vehicles, or food/beverages).\n- **Net Cash GST Outflow Estimator:**\n  - Enter expected Gross Output GST collected from retail sales.\n  - Subtracts eligible purchase ITC to compute **Net Payable GST in Cash** and highlights direct cash saved.\n\n##### E. 1-Click Export\n- **`[📥 Download Tax & ITC Sheet (CSV)]`**: Generates a UTF-8 BOM CSV containing invoice details, regime and scheme configuration, profit breakdown, deductions claimed, slab-by-slab tax, and ITC cash flow.\n- **`[🖨️ Print / PDF]`**: Triggers a print-ready view formatted for Chartered Accountants (CA) with unneeded UI buttons hidden.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n\n1. **Deterministic Test Suite:**\n   - **Mode B Presumptive (Turnover ₹36L, 60% Digital @ 6%, 40% Cash @ 8%):**\n     - Digital Profit: ₹1,29,600 | Cash Profit: ₹1,15,200 | Deemed Profit: ₹2,44,800\n     - Net Taxable Income: ₹1,69,800 (after ₹75,000 standard deduction)\n     - Sec 87A full rebate applied: **₹0 Tax Payable** (100% verified)\n   - **Mode A Regular P&L (Turnover ₹50L, COGS ₹30L, Opex ₹5L):**\n     - Profit: ₹15,00,000 | Taxable: ₹14,25,000 | Slabs + 4% Cess: ₹1,30,000\n     - Blocked ITC under Sec 17(5) verified when toggle is set to `No`.\n2. **Module & Asset Serving:**\n   - All components ([`TaxFilingDashboard.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/TaxFilingDashboard.js), [`ReviewWorkspace.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/ReviewWorkspace.js), [`taxCalculator.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/taxCalculator.js), [`app.js`](file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/app.js)) tested and served with HTTP 200 on [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).","thinking":"The prompt requires a tabbed navigation bar within the invoice review view. The existing component needs to be updated to include two tabs: \"Invoice Math Audit\" (the current view) and a new \"Tax & ITR Filing\" tab. The implementation should be within the specified JavaScript file.\n\n\nThe existing invoice review component needs tabbed navigation. The first tab, \"Invoice Math Audit\", will retain its current functionality, sourcing from existing JavaScript files.\n\nA new \"Tax & ITR Filing\" tab requires a customizable tax engine. This includes a regime and filing type selector allowing for both new and old tax regimes, with two filing modes. Mode A calculates net taxable profit based on gross revenue and expenses, while Mode B offers a presumptive taxation approach with customizable digital/cash percentages.\n\n\nThe \"Tax & ITR Filing\" tab requires detailed tax computation logic. It needs a revenue calculation based on digital and cash sales with customizable percentages.  Custom deduction fields are needed based on the tax regime, with standard deductions auto-applied for the new regime. A dynamic tax slab engine will compute and display tax breakdowns, including cess and effective tax rates.\n\nFurther requirements include a GST Input Tax Credit (ITC) audit that checks eligibility and estimates net GST outflow.  Finally, a one-click export will provide a downloadable tax computation sheet. This will all be implemented within the specified JavaScript file.\n\n\n"}
{"step_index":1893,"source":"USER_EXPLICIT","type":"USER_INPUT","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:33:55Z","content":"<USER_REQUEST>\nINTEGRATION: WIRE TAB 2 (TAX & ITR FILING) INTO APP.JS WITH REACTIVE TAB SWITCHER\n\nConnect the newly created `TaxAndITRTab` component into `app.js` with a top-level tab switcher.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. COMPONENT IMPORT (app.js):\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nImport the new component at the top of `app.js`:\nimport TaxAndITRTab from './components/TaxAndITRTab'; // Ensure path matches your structure\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2. STATE MANAGEMENT (app.js):\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAdd an active tab state hook inside the main App component:\nconst [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState('audit'); // 'audit' | 'tax'\n\nEnsure the active tab defaults to 'audit' upon uploading a new bill or resetting.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3. TOP NAVIGATION SWITCHER BAR:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPlace this tab switcher bar immediately below the top header / action bar and above the main content area (visible whenever an invoice has been loaded/parsed):\n\n<div className=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-slate-200 px-6 pt-3 bg-white\">\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    onClick={() => setActiveTab('audit')}\n    className={`pb-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 transition-colors ${\n      activeTab === 'audit'\n        ? 'border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600'\n        : 'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800'\n    }`}\n  >\n    <span>🧾</span>\n    <span>Invoice Math Audit</span>\n  </button>\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    onClick={() => setActiveTab('tax')}\n    className={`pb-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 transition-colors ${\n      activeTab === 'tax'\n        ? 'border-indigo-600 text-indigo-600'\n        : 'border-transparent text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800'\n    }`}\n  >\n    <span>📊</span>\n    <span>Tax & ITR Filing</span>\n  </button>\n</div>\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n4. CONDITIONAL RENDERING / VIEW SWAP:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nWrap the existing verification screen content and the new Tab 2 screen:\n\n{activeTab === 'audit' ? (\n  /* RENDER CURRENT INVOICE MATH AUDIT VIEW COMPLETELY UNTOUCHED */\n  <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 p-6\">\n    {/* Left Column: PDF / Image preview */}\n    {/* Right Column: Top metric cards, editable item table, GST split box, action buttons */}\n  </div>\n) : (\n  /* RENDER TAB 2: TAX & ITR FILING DASHBOARD */\n  <div className=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6\">\n    <TaxAndITRTab \n      verifiedInvoice={{\n        subtotal: invoiceData?.subtotal || 0,\n        cgst: invoiceData?.cgst || 0,\n        sgst: invoiceData?.sgst || 0,\n        igst: invoiceData?.igst || 0,\n        total_declared: invoiceData?.declared_total ?? invoiceData?.total_declared ?? 0,\n        vendor_name: invoiceData?.vendor_name || '',\n        gstin: invoiceData?.gstin || '',\n        items: invoiceData?.items || []\n      }}\n    />\n  </div>\n)}\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n5. REACTIVE STATE SHARING:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nEnsure that whenever values change in Tab 1 (e.g., user edits CGST/SGST, toggles an 18% quick button, or updates item prices), the updated state in `invoiceData` flows reactively into `TaxAndITRTab` so the ITC and turnover calculations reflect the verified figures instantly.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSCOPE GUARD:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDO NOT modify or refactor any existing table row editing handlers, file upload flows, privacy masking, reverse-token extraction, or audit status math. Keep all existing functions, handlers, and state hooks intact.\n\n\nimport React, { useState } from 'react';\n\nexport default function TaxAndITRTab({ verifiedInvoice }) {\n  // --- Zone 1: Current Invoice State (Derived directly from Tab 1) ---\n  const cgst = verifiedInvoice?.cgst || 0;\n  const sgst = verifiedInvoice?.sgst || 0;\n  const igst = verifiedInvoice?.igst || 0;\n  const totalITC = cgst + sgst + igst;\n  const [isBusinessExpense, setIsBusinessExpense] = useState(true);\n\n  // --- Zone 2: Annual Business Planning State ---\n  const [calcMode, setCalcMode] = useState('44AD'); // '44AD' or 'REGULAR'\n  const [annualTurnover, setAnnualTurnover] = useState(3000000);\n  const [digitalShare, setDigitalShare] = useState(80); // 80% digital, 20% cash\n  const [digitalRate, setDigitalRate] = useState(6.0);\n  const [cashRate, setCashRate] = useState(8.0);\n  const [operatingExpenses, setOperatingExpenses] = useState(450000);\n\n  // 44AD Math\n  const digitalTurnover = (annualTurnover * digitalShare) / 100;\n  const cashTurnover = annualTurnover - digitalTurnover;\n  const deemedProfit = \n    (digitalTurnover * (digitalRate / 100)) + \n    (cashTurnover * (cashRate / 100));\n\n  // Normal P&L Math\n  const netProfitRegular = Math.max(0, annualTurnover - operatingExpenses);\n\n  const taxableIncome = calcMode === '44AD' ? deemedProfit : netProfitRegular;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-6 text-slate-800\">\n      \n      {/* ZONE 1: CURRENT INVOICE ITC */}\n      <section className=\"bg-blue-50/60 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-blue-200 pb-2 mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <span className=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-700 bg-blue-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">\n              Current Bill\n            </span>\n            <h3 className=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">GST Input Tax Credit (ITC)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Auto-extracted from Invoice</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-3\">\n          <div className=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 shadow-sm\">\n            <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Claimable ITC</div>\n            <div className=\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-900\">\n              ₹{isBusinessExpense ? totalITC.toLocaleString('en-IN') : '0.00'}\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">\n              CGST: ₹{cgst} | SGST: ₹{sgst} | IGST: ₹{igst}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 shadow-sm\">\n            <div className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Compliance Status</div>\n            <div className=\"text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-700 mt-1 flex items-center gap-1\">\n              <span>●</span> {isBusinessExpense ? '100% Eligible (Sec 16)' : 'Ineligible (Sec 17(5))'}\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5\">Valid Supplier GSTIN format</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Business Resale Toggle */}\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between bg-white px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 text-xs\">\n          <span className=\"text-slate-700 font-medium\">Purchased for business inventory or resale?</span>\n          <div className=\"flex gap-2\">\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setIsBusinessExpense(true)}\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-medium ${isBusinessExpense ? 'bg-blue-600 text-white' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600'}`}\n            >\n              Yes\n            </button>\n            <button\n              onClick={() => setIsBusinessExpense(false)}\n              className={`px-2.5 py-1 rounded font-medium ${!isBusinessExpense ? 'bg-red-600 text-white' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600'}`}\n            >\n              No (Personal)\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      {/* ZONE 2: ANNUAL ITR ESTIMATOR */}\n      <section className=\"bg-purple-50/50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-purple-200 pb-2 mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <span className=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700 bg-purple-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">\n              Annual Estimator\n            </span>\n            <h3 className=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">Income Tax Planning (ITR-4 / ITR-3)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span className=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Full Business Simulation</span>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Scheme Toggle */}\n        <div className=\"flex gap-2 mb-4\">\n          <button\n            onClick={() => setCalcMode('44AD')}\n            className={`flex-1 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border transition ${\n              calcMode === '44AD'\n                ? 'bg-purple-600 text-white border-purple-600 shadow-sm'\n                : 'bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50'\n            }`}\n          >\n            Presumptive (Sec 44AD / ITR-4)\n          </button>\n          <button\n            onClick={() => setCalcMode('REGULAR')}\n            className={`flex-1 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border transition ${\n              calcMode === 'REGULAR'\n                ? 'bg-purple-600 text-white border-purple-600 shadow-sm'\n                : 'bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50'\n            }`}\n          >\n            Normal P&L (ITR-3)\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Inputs */}\n        <div className=\"space-y-3\">\n          <div>\n            <label className=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">\n              Estimated Annual Gross Sales / Turnover (₹)\n            </label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              value={annualTurnover}\n              onChange={(e) => setAnnualTurnover(Number(e.target.value))}\n              className=\"w-full text-sm font-semibold bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 outline-none\"\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          {calcMode === '44AD' ? (\n            <>\n              <div>\n                <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-600 mb-1\">\n                  <span>Digital / UPI Receipts: <strong>{digitalShare}%</strong></span>\n                  <span>Cash: <strong>{100 - digitalShare}%</strong></span>\n                </div>\n                <input\n                  type=\"range\"\n                  min=\"0\"\n                  max=\"100\"\n                  value={digitalShare}\n                  onChange={(e) => setDigitalShare(Number(e.target.value))}\n                  className=\"w-full accent-purple-600 cursor-pointer\"\n                />\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-xs\">\n                <div>\n                  <label className=\"text-slate-600\">Digital Profit Rate (%)</label>\n                  <input\n                    type=\"number\"\n                    step=\"0.5\"\n                    value={digitalRate}\n                    onChange={(e) => setDigitalRate(Number(e.target.value))}\n                    className=\"w-full mt-1 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded px-2 py-1\"\n                  />\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                  <label className=\"text-slate-600\">Cash Profit Rate (%)</label>\n                  <input\n                    type=\"number\"\n                    step=\"0.5\"\n                    value={cashRate}\n                    onChange={(e) => setCashRate(Number(e.target.value))}\n                    className=\"w-full mt-1 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded px-2 py-1\"\n                  />\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </>\n          ) : (\n            <div>\n              <label className=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">\n                Estimated Total Deductible Operating Expenses (₹)\n              </label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                value={operatingExpenses}\n                onChange={(e) => setOperatingExpenses(Number(e.target.value))}\n                className=\"w-full text-sm font-semibold bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 outline-none\"\n              />\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Calculation Summary Card */}\n        <div className=\"mt-4 bg-white p-3 rounded-lg border border-purple-200 space-y-1.5\">\n          <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs\">\n            <span className=\"text-slate-600\">Deemed Net Taxable Income:</span>\n            <span className=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">₹{Math.round(taxableIncome).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex justify-between text-xs\">\n            <span className=\"text-slate-600\">Tax Payable (New Regime):</span>\n            <span className=\"font-bold text-emerald-600\">₹0 (Full Sec 87A Rebate)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 text-[11px] text-slate-500\">\n            {calcMode === '44AD'\n              ? '✓ No formal books of accounts or balance sheet required under Section 44AB.'\n              : 'Requires maintaining full vouchers, expense receipts, and profit & loss statement.'}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nBACKEND INTEGRATION: ADD TAX ADVISORY & ITR/ITC COMPUTATION ENDPOINTS\n\nAdd a dedicated calculation and compliance route in FastAPI / backend to support the new \"Tax & ITR Filing\" tab.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n1. PYDANTIC SCHEMAS (e.g. in schemas.py or main.py):\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\nfrom typing import Optional, List\n\nclass TaxCalculationRequest(BaseModel):\n    calc_mode: str = \"44AD\"  # \"44AD\" or \"REGULAR\"\n    annual_turnover: float = 3000000.0\n    digital_share_percent: float = 80.0\n    digital_profit_rate: float = 6.0\n    cash_profit_rate: float = 8.0\n    operating_expenses: float = 0.0\n    current_invoice_subtotal: float = 0.0\n    current_invoice_cgst: float = 0.0\n    current_invoice_sgst: float = 0.0\n    current_invoice_igst: float = 0.0\n    supplier_gstin: Optional[str] = None\n    buyer_gstin: Optional[str] = None\n\nclass TaxCalculationResponse(BaseModel):\n    # ITC Details\n    total_itc: float\n    is_inter_state: bool\n    gstin_valid: bool\n    itc_compliance_notes: List[str]\n    # Income Tax Projections\n    taxable_business_income: float\n    projected_income_tax: float\n    rebate_87a_applied: bool\n    tax_audit_required: bool\n    itr_form_suggested: str\n    compliance_message: str\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n2. CALCULATION LOGIC & ENDPOINT (e.g. in routes/tax_advisory.py or main.py):\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nfrom fastapi import APIRouter\nimport re\n\nrouter = APIRouter(prefix=\"/api/tax\", tags=[\"Tax & ITR\"])\n\ndef validate_gstin_format(gstin: Optional[str]) -> bool:\n    if not gstin:\n        return False\n    # Standard 15-character Indian GSTIN pattern\n    pattern = r\"^[0-9]{2}[A-Z]{5}[0-9]{4}[A-Z]{1}[1-9A-Z]{1}Z[0-9A-Z]{1}$\"\n    return bool(re.match(pattern, gstin.strip().upper()))\n\n@router.post(\"/calculate-advisory\", response_model=TaxCalculationResponse)\ndef calculate_tax_advisory(req: TaxCalculationRequest):\n    # 1. GST ITC Verification\n    total_itc = round(req.current_invoice_cgst + req.current_invoice_sgst + req.current_invoice_igst, 2)\n    gstin_valid = validate_gstin_format(req.supplier_gstin)\n    \n    # State matching for inter-state determination\n    is_inter_state = False\n    if req.supplier_gstin and req.buyer_gstin and len(req.supplier_gstin) >= 2 and len(req.buyer_gstin) >= 2:\n        is_inter_state = req.supplier_gstin[:2] != req.buyer_gstin[:2]\n\n    itc_notes = []\n    if gstin_valid:\n        itc_notes.append(\"Supplier GSTIN format verified (Section 16 compliant).\")\n    else:\n        itc_notes.append(\"Warning: Supplier GSTIN missing or unverified. Verify on GST portal.\")\n\n    if total_itc > 0:\n        itc_notes.append(f\"Eligible for ₹{total_itc:,.2f} credit in GSTR-3B under Section 16.\")\n        itc_notes.append(\"Statutory 180-Day Rule: Settle supplier payment within 180 days to avoid ITC reversal.\")\n\n    # 2. Income Tax (ITR) Calculation\n    if req.calc_mode == \"44AD\":\n        digital_turnover = (req.annual_turnover * req.digital_share_percent) / 100.0\n        cash_turnover = req.annual_turnover - digital_turnover\n        taxable_income = (digital_turnover * (req.digital_profit_rate / 100.0)) + (cash_turnover * (req.cash_profit_rate / 100.0))\n        itr_form = \"ITR-4 (Sugam)\"\n        tax_audit = req.annual_turnover > 30000000.0 if req.digital_share_percent >= 95.0 else req.annual_turnover > 20000000.0\n        msg = \"Presumptive scheme elected. No formal profit & loss or balance sheet required under Section 44AB.\"\n    else:\n        taxable_income = max(0.0, req.annual_turnover - req.operating_expenses)\n        itr_form = \"ITR-3\"\n        tax_audit = req.annual_turnover > 10000000.0\n        msg = \"Regular business filing. Maintain vouchers, purchase invoices, and expense registers.\"\n\n    taxable_income = round(taxable_income, 2)\n\n    # 3. Tax Slabs (New Tax Regime FY 2025-26 / 2026-27 with Sec 87A rebate)\n    # Under New Regime, income up to 7 Lakhs (or extended limits) gets full 87A rebate\n    rebate_eligible = taxable_income <= 700000.0\n    projected_tax = 0.0 if rebate_eligible else round(taxable_income * 0.10, 2)\n\n    return TaxCalculationResponse(\n        total_itc=total_itc,\n        is_inter_state=is_inter_state,\n        gstin_valid=gstin_valid,\n        itc_compliance_notes=itc_notes,\n        taxable_business_income=taxable_income,\n        projected_income_tax=projected_tax,\n        rebate_87a_applied=rebate_eligible,\n        tax_audit_required=tax_audit,\n        itr_form_suggested=itr_form,\n        compliance_message=msg\n    )\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n3. ROUTE REGISTRATION:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIn your main FastAPI app (`main.py`):\nfrom routes.tax_advisory import router as tax_router # or include directly\napp.include_router(tax_router)\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSCOPE GUARD:\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDO NOT change existing invoice parsing routes, Gemini model calls, or client-side privacy masking endpoints. Simply register this new `/api/tax/calculate-advisory` route alongside existing endpoints.\n\n\n</USER_REQUEST>\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\nThe current local time is: 2026-11-03T02:03:55+05:30.\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>"}
