{"step_index":1919,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:35:41Z","input_tokens":3305,"cache_read_tokens":154204,"output_tokens":6206,"thinking":"The backend endpoint returns the correct data. Examining the frontend integration, the focus shifts to the `TaxAndITRTab` component, given the provided React code and the `verifiedInvoice` prop. The component's state derives directly from the first tab's data.\n\n\nInitial examination of the component's state variables and calculations reveals that the `taxableIncome` value is determined by the `calcMode` state. Specifically, if `calcMode` is '44AD', the calculation utilizes `deemedProfit`, otherwise, it uses `netProfitRegular`. The `deemedProfit` formula appears to handle digital and cash turnover components separately with corresponding rates.\n\n\nAnalyzing `app.js`, the top navigation switcher manages the active tab ('audit' or 'tax'). The `TaxAndITRTab` component is imported and conditionally rendered based on `activeTab`. The `audit` tab's view is rendered when the corresponding condition is met.\n\n\nThe `TaxAndITRTab` component receives invoice data and recomputes everything on updates to the first tab, ensuring reactive updates. Determining whether `TaxAndITRTab` requires internal state or relies on external state (`this.taxTabState`) for preserving user edits (e.g., `calcMode`, turnover, rates) is critical. Supporting both direct rendering and React-based rendering is the design approach.\n\n\nFocusing on the UI elements, the provided snippet outlines the interactive controls and data presentation within the application. It includes GST input and ITC calculation, along with an annual income tax estimator that supports both presumptive and normal schemes, each having its own specific inputs. The calculations of the `taxableIncome` change based on user input for both `calcMode` and the values entered in various other form elements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"// Component: TaxAndITRTab\n// Zone 1: Current Invoice ITC (Derived directly from Tab 1)\n// Zone 2: Annual Business Planning State (Sec 44AD vs Normal P&L)\n\nexport function renderTaxAndITRTab(container, props = {}) {\n  const { verifiedInvoice = {}, state = {}, onUpdateState } = props;\n\n  // --- Zone 1: Current Invoice State (Derived directly from Tab 1) ---\n  const cgst = Number(verifiedInvoice.cgst) || 0;\n  const sgst = Number(verifiedInvoice.sgst) || 0;\n  const igst = Number(verifiedInvoice.igst) || 0;\n  const totalITC = round2(cgst + sgst + igst);\n  const isBusinessExpense = state.isBusinessExpense !== undefined ? state.isBusinessExpense : true;\n\n  // --- Zone 2: Annual Business Planning State ---\n  const calcMode = state.calcMode || '44AD'; // '44AD' or 'REGULAR'\n  const annualTurnover = state.annualTurnover !== undefined ? Number(state.annualTurnover) : 3000000;\n  const digitalShare = state.digitalShare !== undefined ? Number(state.digitalShare) : 80; // 80% digital, 20% cash\n  const digitalRate = state.digitalRate !== undefined ? Number(state.digitalRate) : 6.0;\n  const cashRate = state.cashRate !== undefined ? Number(state.cashRate) : 8.0;\n  const operatingExpenses = state.operatingExpenses !== undefined ? Number(state.operatingExpenses) : 450000;\n\n  // 44AD Math\n  const digitalTurnover = (annualTurnover * digitalShare) / 100;\n  const cashTurnover = annualTurnover - digitalTurnover;\n  const deemedProfit = \n    (digitalTurnover * (digitalRate / 100)) + \n    (cashTurnover * (cashRate / 100));\n\n  // Normal P&L Math\n  const netProfitRegular = Math.max(0, annualTurnover - operatingExpenses);\n\n  const taxableIncome = calcMode === '44AD' ? deemedProfit : netProfitRegular;\n\n  // New Tax Regime Sec 87A check\n  const isRebateEligible = taxableIncome <= 700000;\n  const projectedTax = isRebateEligible ? 0 : round2(taxableIncome * 0.10);\n\n  // Supplier GSTIN check\n  const supplierGstin = (verifiedInvoice.gstin || \"\").trim().toUpperCase();\n  const isGstinValid = /^[0-9]{2}[A-Z]{5}[0-9]{4}[A-Z]{1}[1-9A-Z]{1}Z[0-9A-Z]{1}$/.test(supplierGstin);\n\n  container.innerHTML = `\n    <div class=\"space-y-6 text-slate-800\">\n      \n      <!-- ZONE 1: CURRENT INVOICE ITC -->\n      <section class=\"bg-blue-50/60 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-blue-200 pb-2 mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-700 bg-blue-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">\n              Current Bill\n            </span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">GST Input Tax Credit (ITC)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono\">Auto-extracted from Invoice</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-3\">\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Claimable ITC</div>\n            <div class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mt-0.5\">\n              ₹${isBusinessExpense ? totalITC.toLocaleString('en-IN', { minimumFractionDigits: 2, maximumFractionDigits: 2 }) : '0.00'}\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1 font-mono\">\n              CGST: ₹${cgst.toLocaleString('en-IN', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })} | SGST: ₹${sgst.toLocaleString('en-IN', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })} | IGST: ₹${igst.toLocaleString('en-IN', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 shadow-sm\">\n            <div class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">Compliance Status</div>\n            <div class=\"text-sm font-semibold ${isBusinessExpense ? 'text-emerald-700' : 'text-rose-600'} mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n              <span>●</span> ${isBusinessExpense ? '100% Eligible (Sec 16)' : 'Ineligible (Sec 17(5))'}\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1\">\n              ${isGstinValid ? 'Valid Supplier GSTIN format' : (supplierGstin ? 'Supplier GSTIN format unverified' : 'Supplier GSTIN missing')}\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Business Resale Toggle -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between bg-white px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-blue-100 text-xs gap-2\">\n          <span class=\"text-slate-700 font-medium\">Purchased for business inventory or resale?</span>\n          <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              id=\"btn-toggle-business-yes\"\n              class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded font-medium transition-all ${isBusinessExpense ? 'bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-sm' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200'}\"\n            >\n              Yes\n            </button>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              id=\"btn-toggle-business-no\"\n              class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded font-medium transition-all ${!isBusinessExpense ? 'bg-red-600 text-white shadow-sm' : 'bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200'}\"\n            >\n              No (Personal)\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- ZONE 2: ANNUAL ITR ESTIMATOR -->\n      <section class=\"bg-purple-50/50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4 sm:p-5 shadow-sm\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-purple-200 pb-2 mb-3\">\n          <div>\n            <span class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-700 bg-purple-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">\n              Annual Estimator\n            </span>\n            <h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-1\">Income Tax Planning (ITR-4 / ITR-3)</h3>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono\">Full Business Simulation</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Scheme Toggle -->\n        <div class=\"flex gap-2 mb-4\">\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            id=\"btn-scheme-44ad\"\n            class=\"flex-1 py-2 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border transition-all ${\n              calcMode === '44AD'\n                ? 'bg-purple-600 text-white border-purple-600 shadow-sm font-semibold'\n                : 'bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50'\n            }\"\n          >\n            Presumptive (Sec 44AD / ITR-4)\n          </button>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            id=\"btn-scheme-regular\"\n            class=\"flex-1 py-2 text-xs font-medium rounded-lg border transition-all ${\n              calcMode === 'REGULAR'\n                ? 'bg-purple-600 text-white border-purple-600 shadow-sm font-semibold'\n                : 'bg-white text-slate-700 border-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-50'\n            }\"\n          >\n            Normal P&L (ITR-3)\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Inputs -->\n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div>\n            <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">\n              Estimated Annual Gross Sales / Turnover (₹)\n            </label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              id=\"input-annual-turnover\"\n              value=\"${annualTurnover}\"\n              class=\"w-full text-sm font-semibold bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 outline-none\"\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          ${calcMode === '44AD' ? `\n            <div>\n              <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs text-slate-600 mb-1\">\n                <span>Digital / UPI Receipts: <strong>${digitalShare}%</strong></span>\n                <span>Cash: <strong>${100 - digitalShare}%</strong></span>\n              </div>\n              <input\n                type=\"range\"\n                id=\"slider-digital-share\"\n                min=\"0\"\n                max=\"100\"\n                value=\"${digitalShare}\"\n                class=\"w-full accent-purple-600 cursor-pointer\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n              <div>\n                <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-medium\">Digital Profit Rate (%)</label>\n                <input\n                  type=\"number\"\n                  id=\"input-digital-rate\"\n                  step=\"0.5\"\n                  value=\"${digitalRate}\"\n                  class=\"w-full mt-1 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 outline-none\"\n                />\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-medium\">Cash Profit Rate (%)</label>\n                <input\n                  type=\"number\"\n                  id=\"input-cash-rate\"\n                  step=\"0.5\"\n                  value=\"${cashRate}\"\n                  class=\"w-full mt-1 bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 outline-none\"\n                />\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ` : `\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-1\">\n                Estimated Total Deductible Operating Expenses (₹)\n              </label>\n              <input\n                type=\"number\"\n                id=\"input-operating-expenses\"\n                value=\"${operatingExpenses}\"\n                class=\"w-full text-sm font-semibold bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 outline-none\"\n              />\n            </div>\n          `}\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Calculation Summary Card -->\n        <div class=\"mt-4 bg-white p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-purple-200 space-y-2\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n            <span class=\"text-slate-600\">Deemed Net Taxable Income:</span>\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900 font-mono\">₹${Math.round(taxableIncome).toLocaleString('en-IN')}</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n            <span class=\"text-slate-600\">Tax Payable (New Regime):</span>\n            <span class=\"font-bold ${isRebateEligible ? 'text-emerald-600' : 'text-slate-900'} font-mono\">\n              ${isRebateEligible ? '₹0 (Full Sec 87A Rebate)' : '₹' + projectedTax.toLocaleString('en-IN', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 })}\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 text-[11px] text-slate-500 leading-relaxed\">\n            ${calcMode === '44AD'\n              ? '✓ No formal books of accounts or balance sheet required under Section 44AB.'\n              : 'Requires maintaining full vouchers, expense receipts, and profit & loss statement.'}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n    </div>\n  `;\n\n  // Attach event handlers\n  setupHandlers(container, {\n    state,\n    onUpdateState,\n    verifiedInvoice\n  });\n}\n\nfunction setupHandlers(container, { state, onUpdateState, verifiedInvoice }) {\n  if (!onUpdateState) return;\n\n  const btnYes = container.querySelector(\"#btn-toggle-business-yes\");\n  const btnNo = container.querySelector(\"#btn-toggle-business-no\");\n  if (btnYes) {\n    btnYes.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ isBusinessExpense: true }));\n  }\n  if (btnNo) {\n    btnNo.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ isBusinessExpense: false }));\n  }\n\n  const btn44ad = container.querySelector(\"#btn-scheme-44ad\");\n  const btnRegular = container.querySelector(\"#btn-scheme-regular\");\n  if (btn44ad) {\n    btn44ad.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ calcMode: '44AD' }));\n  }\n  if (btnRegular) {\n    btnRegular.addEventListener(\"click\", () => onUpdateState({ calcMode: 'REGULAR' }));\n  }\n\n  const inputTurnover = container.querySelector(\"#input-annual-turnover\");\n  if (inputTurnover) {\n    inputTurnover.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ annualTurnover: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const sliderDigital = container.querySelector(\"#slider-digital-share\");\n  if (sliderDigital) {\n    sliderDigital.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ digitalShare: parseInt(e.target.value, 10) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const inputDigitalRate = container.querySelector(\"#input-digital-rate\");\n  if (inputDigitalRate) {\n    inputDigitalRate.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ digitalProfitRate: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const inputCashRate = container.querySelector(\"#input-cash-rate\");\n  if (inputCashRate) {\n    inputCashRate.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ cashRate: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n\n  const inputOpex = container.querySelector(\"#input-operating-expenses\");\n  if (inputOpex) {\n    inputOpex.addEventListener(\"input\", (e) => onUpdateState({ operatingExpenses: parseFloat(e.target.value) || 0 }));\n  }\n}\n\nfunction round2(val) {\n  return Math.round((Number(val) || 0) * 100) / 100;\n}\n\n// Default export for direct import compatibility\nexport default function TaxAndITRTab(props) {\n  if (props && props.target) {\n    renderTaxAndITRTab(props.target, props);\n    return props.target;\n  }\n  return props;\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/components/TaxAndITRTab.js"}}]}
