{"step_index":1921,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:36:22Z","input_tokens":6273,"cache_read_tokens":157518,"output_tokens":1085,"thinking":"Examining `app.js` to locate where to integrate the tab switcher component. Reviewing the prompt's instructions to determine the required component import and integration points within the file. It appears that the top-level tab switcher needs to be imported and wired in the application's main entry point.\n\n\nAdding state management for the active tab using a state hook within the main component, initializing it to 'audit'. This active tab state will default to 'audit' after new bill uploads or resets. A top navigation tab switcher is being placed below the header and above the main content, visible when an invoice is loaded.\n\n\nThe tab switcher's state will now drive conditional rendering.  The 'audit' tab renders existing invoice verification; otherwise, the \"Tax & ITR Filing\" dashboard displays.  The \"Tax & ITR Filing\" tab receives invoice data, ensuring reactivity to data changes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":135,"Path":"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/app.js","StartLine":70}}]}
{"step_index":1922,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T20:36:31Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-03T02:06:31+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-03T02:06:31+05:30\nShowing lines 70-135 of 553\n70:       };\n71:     }\n72: \n73:     if (this.currentView === \"dashboard\") {\n74:       renderDashboardHero(this.mainMount, {\n75:         hasApiKey: !!this.apiKey,\n76:         onSelectSample: (sampleKey) => this.loadSample(sampleKey),\n77:         onFileUpload: (file) => this.handleFileUpload(file),\n78:         onCreateManualBill: () => this.createManualBill(),\n79:         onOpenApiKeyModal: () => this.openApiKeyModal()\n80:       });\n81:     } else if (this.currentView === \"review\") {\n82:       renderReviewWorkspace(this.mainMount, this.currentInvoice, this.currentAudit, {\n83:         activeMainTab: this.activeReviewTab || \"audit\",\n84:         userTaxSettings: this.userTaxSettings,\n85:         onSwitchMainTab: (tab) => {\n86:           this.activeReviewTab = tab;\n87:           this.render();\n88:         },\n89:         taxData: this.taxData,\n90:         onRefreshTaxAi: () => this.handleRefreshTaxAi(),\n91:         onUpdateItem: (idx, action, val) => this.handleUpdateItem(idx, action, val),\n92:         onAddItem: () => this.handleAddItem(),\n93:         onDeleteItem: (idx) => this.handleDeleteItem(idx),\n94:         onUpdateHeader: (field, val) => this.handleUpdateHeader(field, val),\n95:         onAutoFixMath: () => this.handleAutoFixMath(),\n96:         onUpdateTaxSettings: (settings) => this.handleUpdateTaxSettings(settings),\n97:         onSubmitValidInputs: (fields) => this.handleSubmitValidInputs(fields),\n98:         onCopyNote: (openWhatsApp) => this.handleCopyDiscrepancyNote(openWhatsApp),\n99:         onOpenCaSlip: () => this.openCaSlipModal(),\n100:         onBack: () => this.goToDashboard()\n101:       });\n102:     }\n103: \n104:     // Restore focus seamlessly if user was actively typing\n105:     if (focusInfo) {\n106:       let targetInput = null;\n107:       if (focusInfo.id) {\n108:         targetInput = document.getElementById(focusInfo.id);\n109:       } else if (focusInfo.action && focus